tual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p027","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m029-0331","start":331,"end":335,"surface":"王后徐來","kind":"person","person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p029","chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji118-020","subject_person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFC","predicate":"spouse","object_person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p027","quote":"王后乘舒死，立徐來為王后。厥姬俱幸。兩人相妒，厥姬乃惡王后徐來於太子曰：「徐來使婢蠱道殺太子母。」太子心怨徐來。徐來兄至衡山，太子與飲，以刃刺傷王后兄。王后怨怒，數毀惡太子於王。太子女弟無采，嫁棄歸，與奴姦，又與客姦。太子數讓無采，無采怒，不與太子通。王后聞之，即善遇無采。無采及中兄孝少失母，附王后，王后以計愛之，與共毀太子，王以故數擊笞太子。元朔四年中，人有賊傷王后假母者，王疑太子使人傷之，笞太子。後王病，太子時稱病不侍。孝王后、無采惡太子：「太子實不病，自言病，有喜色。」王大怒，欲廢太子，立其弟孝。王后知王決廢太子，又欲并廢孝。王后有侍者，善舞，王幸之，王后欲令侍者與孝亂以汙之，欲并廢兄弟而立其子廣代太子。太子爽知之，念后數惡己無已時，欲與亂以止其口。王后飲，太子前為壽，因據王后股，求與王后臥。王后怒，以告王。王乃召，欲縛而笞之。太子知王常欲廢己立其弟孝，乃謂王曰：「孝與王御者姦，無采與奴姦，王彊食，請上書。」即倍王去。王使人止之，莫能禁，乃自駕追捕太子。太子妄惡言，王械繋太子宮中。孝日益親幸。王奇孝材能，乃佩之王印，號曰將軍，令居外宅，多給金錢，招致賓客。賓客來者，微知淮南、衡山有逆計，日夜從容勸之。王乃使孝客江都人救赫、陳喜作輣車鏃矢，刻天子璽，將相軍吏印。王日夜求壯士如周丘等，數稱引吳楚反時計畫，以約束。衡山王非敢效淮南王求即天子位，畏淮南起并其國，以為淮南已西，發兵定江淮之閒而有之，望如是。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"立徐來為王后"},"interpretation_note":"立后明示，不從姦或汙之計畫推婚姻。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji118-021","subject_person_id":"zjl_v6e_4vk","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p027","quote":"王后乘舒死，立徐來為王后。厥姬俱幸。兩人相妒，厥姬乃惡王后徐來於太子曰：「徐來使婢蠱道殺太子母。」太子心怨徐來。徐來兄至衡山，太子與飲，以刃刺傷王后兄。王后怨怒，數毀惡太子於王。太子女弟無采，嫁棄歸，與奴姦，又與客姦。太子數讓無采，無采怒，不與太子通。王后聞之，即善遇無采。無采及中兄孝少失母，附王后，王后以計愛之，與共毀太子，王以故數擊笞太子。元朔四年中，人有賊傷王后假母者，王疑太子使人傷之，笞太子。後王病，太子時稱病不侍。孝王后、無采惡太子：「太子實不病，自言病，有喜色。」王大怒，欲廢太子，立其弟孝。王后知王決廢太子，又欲并廢孝。王后有侍者，善舞，王幸之，王后欲令侍者與孝亂以汙之，欲并廢兄弟而立其子廣代太子。太子爽知之，念后數惡己無已時，欲與亂以止其口。王后飲，太子前為壽，因據王后股，求與王后臥。王后怒，以告王。王乃召，欲縛而笞之。太子知王常欲廢己立其弟孝，乃謂王曰：「孝與王御者姦，無采與奴姦，王彊食，請上書。」即倍王去。王使人止之，莫能禁，乃自駕追捕太子。太子妄惡言，王械繋太子宮中。孝日益親幸。王奇孝材能，乃佩之王印，號曰將軍，令居外宅，多給金錢，招致賓客。賓客來者，微知淮南、衡山有逆計，日夜從容勸之。王乃使孝客江都人救赫、陳喜作輣車鏃矢，刻天子璽，將相軍吏印。王日夜求壯士如周丘等，數稱引吳楚反時計畫，以約束。衡山王非敢效淮南王求即天子位，畏淮南起并其國，以為淮南已西，發兵定江淮之閒而有之，望如是。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"其子廣"},"interpretation_note":"承接王后欲立其子廣；未由本句直接補父親。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji118-042","person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","title":"王后","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p027","quote":"王后乘舒死，立徐來為王后。厥姬俱幸。兩人相妒，厥姬乃惡王后徐來於太子曰：「徐來使婢蠱道殺太子母。」太子心怨徐來。徐來兄至衡山，太子與飲，以刃刺傷王后兄。王后怨怒，數毀惡太子於王。太子女弟無采，嫁棄歸，與奴姦，又與客姦。太子數讓無采，無采怒，不與太子通。王后聞之，即善遇無采。無采及中兄孝少失母，附王后，王后以計愛之，與共毀太子，王以故數擊笞太子。元朔四年中，人有賊傷王后假母者，王疑太子使人傷之，笞太子。後王病，太子時稱病不侍。孝王后、無采惡太子：「太子實不病，自言病，有喜色。」王大怒，欲廢太子，立其弟孝。王后知王決廢太子，又欲并廢孝。王后有侍者，善舞，王幸之，王后欲令侍者與孝亂以汙之，欲并廢兄弟而立其子廣代太子。太子爽知之，念后數惡己無已時，欲與亂以止其口。王后飲，太子前為壽，因據王后股，求與王后臥。王后怒，以告王。王乃召，欲縛而笞之。太子知王常欲廢己立其弟孝，乃謂王曰：「孝與王御者姦，無采與奴姦，王彊食，請上書。」即倍王去。王使人止之，莫能禁，乃自駕追捕太子。太子妄惡言，王械繋太子宮中。孝日益親幸。王奇孝材能，乃佩之王印，號曰將軍，令居外宅，多給金錢，招致賓客。賓客來者，微知淮南、衡山有逆計，日夜從容勸之。王乃使孝客江都人救赫、陳喜作輣車鏃矢，刻天子璽，將相軍吏印。王日夜求壯士如周丘等，數稱引吳楚反時計畫，以約束。衡山王非敢效淮南王求即天子位，畏淮南起并其國，以為淮南已西，發兵定江淮之閒而有之，望如是。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji118-042:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p027","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"王后","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0007","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p027","quote":"王后乘舒死，立徐來為王后。厥姬俱幸。兩人相妒，厥姬乃惡王后徐來於太子曰：「徐來使婢蠱道殺太子母。」太子心怨徐來。徐來兄至衡山，太子與飲，以刃刺傷王后兄。王后怨怒，數毀惡太子於王。太子女弟無采，嫁棄歸，與奴姦，又與客姦。太子數讓無采，無采怒，不與太子通。王后聞之，即善遇無采。無采及中兄孝少失母，附王后，王后以計愛之，與共毀太子，王以故數擊笞太子。元朔四年中，人有賊傷王后假母者，王疑太子使人傷之，笞太子。後王病，太子時稱病不侍。孝王后、無采惡太子：「太子實不病，自言病，有喜色。」王大怒，欲廢太子，立其弟孝。王后知王決廢太子，又欲并廢孝。王后有侍者，善舞，王幸之，王后欲令侍者與孝亂以汙之，欲并廢兄弟而立其子廣代太子。太子爽知之，念后數惡己無已時，欲與亂以止其口。王后飲，太子前為壽，因據王后股，求與王后臥。王后怒，以告王。王乃召，欲縛而笞之。太子知王常欲廢己立其弟孝，乃謂王曰：「孝與王御者姦，無采與奴姦，王彊食，請上書。」即倍王去。王使人止之，莫能禁，乃自駕追捕太子。太子妄惡言，王械繋太子宮中。孝日益親幸。王奇孝材能，乃佩之王印，號曰將軍，令居外宅，多給金錢，招致賓客。賓客來者，微知淮南、衡山有逆計，日夜從容勸之。王乃使孝客江都人救赫、陳喜作輣車鏃矢，刻天子璽，將相軍吏印。王日夜求壯士如周丘等，數稱引吳楚反時計畫，以約束。衡山王非敢效淮南王求即天子位，畏淮南起并其國，以為淮南已西，發兵定江淮之閒而有之，望如是。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"明示授封與文獻用稱分存，紀年承接及換算待補；廢勿王明示終點，不以死亡自動終止全部稱號。厲王追謚用稱不等同生前即位。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p025","text":"衡山王賜，王后乘舒生子三人，長男爽為太子，次男孝，次女無采。又姬徐來生子男女四人，美人厥姬生子二人。衡山王、淮南王兄弟相責望禮節，閒不相能。衡山王聞淮南王作為畔逆反具，亦心結賓客以應之，恐為所并。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"衡山王賜","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"王后乘舒","kind":"person","person_id":"rw1_4gw_1c3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"子三人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"長男爽","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFCA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"次男孝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFCB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0025","start":25,"end":29,"surface":"次女無采","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFCC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0031","start":31,"end":34,"surface":"姬徐來","kind":"person","person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0036","start":36,"end":40,"surface":"男女四人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0041","start":41,"end":45,"surface":"美人厥姬","kind":"person","person_id":"pbe_ukj_zro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0046","start":46,"end":49,"surface":"子二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0050","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"衡山王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"兄弟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0070","start":70,"end":73,"surface":"衡山王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0074","start":74,"end":77,"surface":"淮南王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m025-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"賓客","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-118-huainan","book_id":"b-shiji-118","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji118-huainan"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:p027","text":"王后乘舒死，立徐來為王后。厥姬俱幸。兩人相妒，厥姬乃惡王后徐來於太子曰：「徐來使婢蠱道殺太子母。」太子心怨徐來。徐來兄至衡山，太子與飲，以刃刺傷王后兄。王后怨怒，數毀惡太子於王。太子女弟無采，嫁棄歸，與奴姦，又與客姦。太子數讓無采，無采怒，不與太子通。王后聞之，即善遇無采。無采及中兄孝少失母，附王后，王后以計愛之，與共毀太子，王以故數擊笞太子。元朔四年中，人有賊傷王后假母者，王疑太子使人傷之，笞太子。後王病，太子時稱病不侍。孝王后、無采惡太子：「太子實不病，自言病，有喜色。」王大怒，欲廢太子，立其弟孝。王后知王決廢太子，又欲并廢孝。王后有侍者，善舞，王幸之，王后欲令侍者與孝亂以汙之，欲并廢兄弟而立其子廣代太子。太子爽知之，念后數惡己無已時，欲與亂以止其口。王后飲，太子前為壽，因據王后股，求與王后臥。王后怒，以告王。王乃召，欲縛而笞之。太子知王常欲廢己立其弟孝，乃謂王曰：「孝與王御者姦，無采與奴姦，王彊食，請上書。」即倍王去。王使人止之，莫能禁，乃自駕追捕太子。太子妄惡言，王械繋太子宮中。孝日益親幸。王奇孝材能，乃佩之王印，號曰將軍，令居外宅，多給金錢，招致賓客。賓客來者，微知淮南、衡山有逆計，日夜從容勸之。王乃使孝客江都人救赫、陳喜作輣車鏃矢，刻天子璽，將相軍吏印。王日夜求壯士如周丘等，數稱引吳楚反時計畫，以約束。衡山王非敢效淮南王求即天子位，畏淮南起并其國，以為淮南已西，發兵定江淮之閒而有之，望如是。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0000","start":0,"end":4,"surface":"王后乘舒","kind":"person","person_id":"rw1_4gw_1c3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"徐來","kind":"person","person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"王后","kind":"person","person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"厥姬","kind":"person","person_id":"pbe_ukj_zro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"厥姬","kind":"person","person_id":"pbe_ukj_zro","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0027","start":27,"end":31,"surface":"王后徐來","kind":"person","person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFCA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"徐來","kind":"person","person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"婢","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFCA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AFCA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"徐來","kind":"person","person_id":"51x_iss_zj5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-118-huainan:m027-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"徐來兄","kind":"person","person_id":"hax_odl_ke